-- Real-estate news v2: the verified RSS feeds from the business spec (rss-feeds.json, 26 Sep 2026).
-- 15 feeds. Idempotent: a feed already in the list (same feed_url) is left alone.
-- Needs migration 0062 (applied on boot by ensureSchema). Run once per environment:
--   psql "$DATABASE_URL" -f seed-rss.sql
-- display_name is the Arabic name; notes carry the English name and why the feed is in the list.
-- site_url is a starting value; the first fetch replaces it with the feed's own channel link.

ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
